# event arms that raise these dialogs are UIParent.xml's, the reference's own home. 0308's engine,
# the 37 dialogs UiPanels.xml carried and the seven free-standing dialog files (Death, Duel,
# QuestShare, EnchantConfirm, BinderConfirm, ConfirmSummon, TalentWipeConfirm) are gone.
Interface\FrameXML\StaticPopup.xml
